Third-party components
----------------------

This product depends on, and in packaged distributions bundles, third-party
software provided under separate terms. The bundled runtime inventory recorded in
`desktop/src-tauri/resources/mirrororder-runtime/mirrororder-runtime-manifest.json`
identifies the media toolchain as an FFmpeg build licensed GPL-2.0-or-later, with its
license files bundled alongside.

A complete, version-accurate third-party license inventory for a given release is
generated at build time rather than maintained by hand here, so that it cannot drift
from the resolved dependency set.
